1
00:00:04,967 --> 00:00:09,217
(Penny:)So I hear you and the lost boys
are having a bachelor party tonight.

2
00:00:09,639 --> 00:00:13,809
(Leonard:)Yeah. Just going to a restaurant, get some
steaks, Scotch. Nothing to worry about.

3
00:00:13,976 --> 00:00:15,226
(Penny:)Why should I worry?

4
00:00:15,394 --> 00:00:18,944
(Leonard:)It's a bachelor party. There could be
strippers. Wouldn't that make you jealous?

5
00:00:19,106 --> 00:00:22,106
Uh, come on, Leonard, it's you.
What's gonna happen?

6
00:00:22,276 --> 00:00:24,236
(Penny:)If there was a stripper, all you'd do...

7
00:00:24,403 --> 00:00:28,743
...is avoid eye contact and maybe offer
to help her kid with his homework.

8
00:00:29,325 --> 00:00:31,665
Hey, I'm a young man
in his sexual prime.

9
00:00:31,869 --> 00:00:37,749
(Leonard:)Under the right conditions,
l am capable ofjust really crazy stuff.

10
00:00:37,917 --> 00:00:41,007
(Penny:)Really? What is the craziest thing
you've ever done with a woman?

11
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:43,510
The time we had sex in the ocean
does not count.

12
00:00:43,673 --> 00:00:46,133
Oh, come on, that's gotta count.

13
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:49,510
(Leonard:)There was a really strong undertow.
We could've died.

14
00:00:50,346 --> 00:00:51,676
(Penny:)Well, have fun tonight.

15
00:00:51,847 --> 00:00:56,807
(Leonard:)Oh, I will. There is no telling
what might happen.

16
00:00:57,687 --> 00:00:59,517
Yeah, there is, heh.

17
00:01:00,773 --> 00:01:08,023
(Leonard:)You know, there's nothing wrong helping
some woman's kid get through their SATs.

